{"sourceUrl":"http://www.psych.zju.edu.cn/2025/0728/c27648a3071863/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:36.170242+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.psych.zju.edu.cn/2025/0728/c27648a3071863/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span> </span><span>欢迎报考浙江大学心理与行为科学系推荐免试研究生。</span></p><h1><span> </span><span>请查阅《</span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"浙江大学关于2026年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知\"><span>浙江大学关于</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</span></a><span>》</span><span>   </span></h1><h1><span>报名注意事项</span><span>：</span></h1><p><strong><span>    一、</span></strong><strong><span>   </span></strong><strong><span>申请者填报</span></strong><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>浙江大学</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年免试生申请</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><strong><span>时，</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（一）申报硕士具体如下：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>申请专业：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>专业学位：应用心理（</span></strong><strong><span>045400</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>攻读方向：</span></strong><span>不区分研究方向</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）申报直博具体如下：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>申请专业：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>学术学位：心理学（</span></strong><strong><span>040200</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>攻读方向：</span></strong><span>不区分研究方向</span></p><p><strong><span>    二、填报时成绩排名应该是</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>个学期（</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span>年）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>    三、推免报名系统打包上传成绩单等附件（小于</span></strong><strong><span>10M</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>附件一般包括：</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>、历年在校学习成绩单、大学英语等级证书复印件、已发表过的学术论文、出版物或工作成果的复印件或证明、在曾从事过的科技活动中获奖或表现突出的书面证明；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、申请直接攻读博士学位者还须提供两位与申请学科有关的副教授（或相当职称）及以上专家的</span><span> “</span><a href=\"http://grs-zju-edu-cn.webvpn.zju.edu.cn:8001/zjugrs/UserFiles/File/zsc/sszs/zjtjs.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>专家推荐信</span></a><span>”</span><span>（模板见通知附件，请将专家推荐书扫描后上传）。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、所在专业成绩排名、所在高校的推免资格证明（如所在学校尚未公示推免资格，可暂不提交，在推免复试前补交）等。</span></p><p><strong><span>注：</span></strong><span>填报申请材料不得弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其来我校的免试读研资格，并通报申请人所在学校）</span></p><p><strong><span>    四、申请者在网上填报即可（报名截止时间：9月10日；初审是否通过即是否具有复试资格，按往年是在</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>18</span></strong><strong><span>日以后统一审核确定，请关注报名网页及心理系网站通知。）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>    五、初审通过具有复试资格的学生，复试时须具有本科所在院校的推免资格。</span></strong></p><p><span>未尽事宜，请咨询心理系研究生科。</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:cuiwr@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>cuiwr@zju.edu.cn</span></a><span> </span></p><p><span>咨询电话：</span><span>0571-88273068/88273416</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>附件：</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/580f6d872fc89bf2c82e.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.psych.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/93/7c/fe5594074e22bfbaf025310a428b/be3ec7f9-e9be-4423-bd09-d9668637e906.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家推荐信模板.docx</a></p><p><span>                                                   </span><span>心理系</span></p><p><span>                                               202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span>24</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"cf20d046782609a22eceb30021d150c6158be64d451a587ec22f3456824265ad","textLength":685,"sourceSha256":"3b554bf27cb5e8f0cc7312d0e142a5525ece2cf25c6c1a5a7a79ec74f0990f99","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f8f566e56cf2c14a43a7","title":"2025年浙江大学心理与行为科学系关于2026年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:36.170242+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.psych.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/580f6d872fc89bf2c82e.gif"}]}
